{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24522","headline":"和杨尚书罢相後夏日游永安水亭兼招本曹杨侍郎同行 · 白居易","name":"和杨尚书罢相後夏日游永安水亭兼招本曹杨侍郎同行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道行无喜退无忧，舒卷如云得自由。\n良冶动时爲哲匠，巨川济了作虚舟。\n竹亭阴合偏宜夏，水槛风凉不待秋。\n遥爱翩翩双紫凤，入同官署出同游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}